Subject: [PATCH] SourbyCraft - plugin API types from dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.api

The region-threading plugin API (formerly Canvas's API package) moved to
dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.api in Build 48 (owner decision 2026-10-21, no
compatibility shim). The engine baseline names these types by their
simple names only, because a baseline line may not name a SourbyCraft
package; this patch supplies the imports.

diff --git a/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/datapack/Datapack.java b/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/datapack/Datapack.java
index b6be0ed3cfc379827ec38415c0a13b3cf0b7280b..fef0e0ab31666a04ef4af5025ac1f57c835e0508 100644
--- a/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/datapack/Datapack.java
+++ b/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/datapack/Datapack.java
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@ import net.kyori.adventure.text.Component;
 import org.jetbrains.annotations.ApiStatus;
 import org.jetbrains.annotations.Contract;
 import org.jspecify.annotations.NullMarked;
+import dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.api.Unsupported;
 
 /**
  * This is a snapshot of a datapack on the server. It
